# one script, several features: render all, or one with --feature, or --split for one file each
Size 90x20
Theme matrix
Title "features"
Setup seq 1 200 | sed 's/^/line /' > $HOME/long.txt
Cd /tmp
Run less $HOME/long.txt
Sleep 300ms

Feature "Page scroll"
Caption "PageScroll down" bottom
PageScroll down 2
PageScroll up 1

Feature "Cut the loading"
Caption "Slow part cut out" bottom
Cut
SendKey g
WaitFor "line 1" 5s
CutEnd
SendKey G
Sleep 400ms
